repository-code: "https://github.com/ParaCoToUl/cellato"
url: "https://github.com/ParaCoToUl/cellato"
abstract: >-
  Cellato is a C++20 library and embedded domain-specific language (DSL) for cellular automata.
  It lets you describe an automaton rule as a type-level C++ expression, then run that same rule
  through different evaluators, memory layouts (standard cells, bit arrays, bit planes, tiled bit planes),
  and traversers (CPU, CUDA, spatial blocking, temporal blocking).
